  (text "LOCAL DECOUPLING / one low-inductance bypass per supply pin, four core paddles on 0.9 V"
    (at 15 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "2197336d-ad7d-520b-95cc-f1e3e8914516")
  )
  (text "XMOS recommends at least eight 100n core bypass capacitors plus >=10u bulk on the core and I/O rails.\nUse direct short returns to the central ground paddle, never route 61-64 to ground.\nPlacement and via geometry still require layout review; schematic capacitance does not establish supply integrity."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
